WEBVTT

00:00.757 --> 00:02.637
<b>Hey. Do you wanna team up?</b>

00:02.757 --> 00:04.427
<b>-Nah. Thanks.
-Wha...</b>

00:07.767 --> 00:10.387
<b>[ELYMAS] A Fang of
Smoldering Insanity skill book.</b>

00:11.057 --> 00:13.187
<b>If I had one in my possession,</b>

00:13.307 --> 00:15.477
<b>I'd be able
to unlock an entire skill tree.</b>

00:16.067 --> 00:19.527
<b>They're extremely rare,
so I won't find one right away,</b>

00:20.147 --> 00:21.907
<b>but looking for one is free.</b>

00:24.327 --> 00:25.787
<b>Oath of the Heavy Armor.</b>

00:26.367 --> 00:28.827
<b>And Fang of Smoldering Insanity.</b>

00:28.957 --> 00:30.957
<b>These are two skill trees
that work together</b>

00:31.077 --> 00:32.747
<b>to complete the Heavy Knight.</b>

00:33.957 --> 00:35.377
<b>And when that happens,</b>

00:35.457 --> 00:37.957
<b>the Heavy Knight is no longer
a defense specialist,</b>

00:38.087 --> 00:40.257
<b>but referring to it
as an offense specialist</b>

00:40.377 --> 00:41.427
<b>isn't right either.</b>

00:42.047 --> 00:45.467
<b>At that point,
it becomes a human weapon.</b>

00:46.717 --> 00:50.227
<b>If I want to move forward
and unlock my true potential,</b>

00:50.347 --> 00:52.597
<b>Fang of Smoldering Insanity
is vital.</b>

00:52.727 --> 00:54.937
<b>[indistinct chatter]</b>

01:00.817 --> 01:03.867
<b>[♪ opening theme song playing]</b>

02:35.827 --> 02:37.457
<b>[♪ bright music playing]</b>

02:37.577 --> 02:39.377
<b>[indistinct chatter]</b>

02:40.247 --> 02:43.127
<b>Whoa, she's so cute!
[sighs] Who am I kidding?</b>

02:48.507 --> 02:49.927
<b>Hmm.</b>

02:54.517 --> 02:55.807
<b>Hmm.</b>

02:58.727 --> 03:01.227
<b>-Now, don't you waste it.
-Oh, I won't.</b>

03:01.767 --> 03:02.777
<b>Thanks, Dad.</b>

03:03.607 --> 03:05.697
<b>[ELYMAS] A Fang of
Smoldering Insanity skill book</b>

03:05.817 --> 03:08.107
<b>is essential
for making my class viable.</b>

03:09.067 --> 03:10.157
<b>It'd be great if I were able</b>

03:10.277 --> 03:12.117
<b>to find one
somewhere in this city.</b>

03:35.017 --> 03:36.097
<b>Hmm.</b>

03:37.557 --> 03:38.557
<b>Excuse me.</b>

03:39.347 --> 03:41.357
<b>Could you give me
three healing potions?</b>

03:41.477 --> 03:44.267
<b>Sure thing. It's 72,000 gold.</b>

03:46.357 --> 03:47.857
<b>[ELYMAS] That's a whole lot
more expensive</b>

03:47.987 --> 03:49.107
<b>than it was in the game.</b>

03:50.027 --> 03:53.077
<b>Then again, I guess
there's no way around it.</b>

03:53.537 --> 03:55.827
<b>-[coins jingle]
-Very well.</b>

03:57.287 --> 03:59.247
<b>By the way,
I have a question for you.</b>

03:59.367 --> 04:00.287
<b>Mm?</b>

04:00.577 --> 04:02.837
<b>Do you know where I can buy
some skill books?</b>

04:03.337 --> 04:04.377
<b>Oh.</b>

04:05.297 --> 04:08.087
<b>They don't seem to be available
in any shops around here.</b>

04:09.297 --> 04:11.217
<b>A Heavy Knight is stuck
in tutorial mode</b>

04:11.337 --> 04:14.597
<b>until they find a Fang of
Smoldering Insanity skill book.</b>

04:14.717 --> 04:16.307
<b>I have to get my hands on one.</b>

04:16.427 --> 04:19.557
<b>[CLERK] Really?
You don't know anything, do you?</b>

04:20.477 --> 04:23.067
<b>If I had to guess, I'd say
you're a first-year adventurer</b>

04:23.187 --> 04:24.937
<b>who just got his class, right?</b>

04:25.067 --> 04:26.237
<b>Uh, yeah.</b>

04:27.027 --> 04:28.857
<b>Purchasing and selling
skill books</b>

04:28.987 --> 04:30.147
<b>is strictly prohibited.</b>

04:30.277 --> 04:31.567
<b>Huh?</b>

04:31.697 --> 04:33.487
<b>People who acquire a skill book</b>

04:33.617 --> 04:35.117
<b>are allowed to use it,
of course.</b>

04:35.237 --> 04:37.827
<b>But any extra or unused ones
must be turned over</b>

04:37.947 --> 04:39.787
<b>to the Adventurer's Guild,
where they're sold off</b>

04:39.907 --> 04:41.787
<b>to the church affiliates
and nobles.</b>

04:42.827 --> 04:44.537
<b>[gasps] You're kidding!</b>

04:45.247 --> 04:47.087
<b>They're an incredibly rare drop.</b>

04:47.207 --> 04:49.007
<b>It's assumed
you have to buy them,</b>

04:49.127 --> 04:50.507
<b>and they'll cost a lot of gold.</b>

04:51.047 --> 04:52.887
<b>Though, there's only
a small chance that you'll find</b>

04:53.007 --> 04:54.257
<b>the one you're looking for.</b>

04:55.557 --> 04:56.967
<b>From the beginning,</b>

04:57.097 --> 04:59.557
<b>it did feel like the nobles
out here were more powerful</b>

04:59.677 --> 05:00.977
<b>than they were in the game,</b>

05:01.597 --> 05:04.647
<b>but I can't believe this is
what's actually happening.</b>

05:05.647 --> 05:07.277
<b>At this point,</b>

05:07.397 --> 05:10.067
<b>it wouldn't surprise me
if the skill books in Rondalm</b>

05:10.197 --> 05:12.817
<b>have all been bought up
and hidden away by my family,</b>

05:12.947 --> 05:14.027
<b>the Edvaughns.</b>

05:15.317 --> 05:16.527
<b>[sighs]</b>

05:17.867 --> 05:19.697
<b>-All right, fine.
-Huh?</b>

05:19.827 --> 05:21.707
<b>[CLERK] I'm not supposed
to tell you this,</b>

05:21.827 --> 05:23.707
<b>but I'll make an exception
just this once.</b>

05:23.827 --> 05:24.747
<b>[scribbling]</b>

05:24.957 --> 05:27.747
<b>After all, you bought
the healing potions.</b>

05:31.177 --> 05:33.717
<b>Here. Give that place a try.</b>

05:36.047 --> 05:37.097
<b>What's this?</b>

05:39.267 --> 05:41.937
<b>It's a shop known for dealing
in scavenged goods.</b>

05:42.387 --> 05:45.397
<b>[ELYMAS] Don't scavengers loot
dead adventurers?</b>

05:46.437 --> 05:47.857
<b>I don't understand.</b>

05:48.477 --> 05:50.107
<b>If any of those items are found,</b>

05:50.237 --> 05:51.487
<b>aren't they supposed
to be reported</b>

05:51.607 --> 05:52.987
<b>to the Adventurer's Guild?</b>

05:53.697 --> 05:55.737
<b>[CLERK] Well, they have
an unspoken agreement.</b>

05:55.867 --> 05:58.407
<b>Although the guild knows
about these underground shops,</b>

05:58.527 --> 06:00.617
<b>they usually
just turn a blind eye.</b>

06:01.117 --> 06:03.407
<b>There are plenty of adventurers
who wouldn't survive</b>

06:03.537 --> 06:05.667
<b>without scavenging
every once in a while.</b>

06:05.787 --> 06:08.667
<b>Even if they chose
to follow standard procedure,</b>

06:08.797 --> 06:11.627
<b>most items would just end up
in the hands of nobles</b>

06:11.757 --> 06:13.297
<b>instead of
their surviving families.</b>

06:13.717 --> 06:14.757
<b>[gasps]</b>

06:15.297 --> 06:16.587
<b>[CLERK] Rather than using them,</b>

06:16.717 --> 06:18.887
<b>nobles buy up skill books
for almost nothing,</b>

06:19.007 --> 06:21.177
<b>and then hoard the ones
they've gathered.</b>

06:21.307 --> 06:24.187
<b>They don't know how hard
it is to be an adventurer.</b>

06:24.307 --> 06:26.267
<b>[seething]</b>

06:27.727 --> 06:30.767
<b>[ELYMAS] I'm starting to realize
how utterly naive I was.</b>

06:31.527 --> 06:34.197
<b>If the memories of my past life
had never returned,</b>

06:34.317 --> 06:36.277
<b>and I'd become
a Master Swordsman...</b>

06:37.237 --> 06:39.777
<b>[CLERK] Now, don't go around
telling the mucky-mucks</b>

06:39.907 --> 06:41.577
<b>about this shop, all right?</b>

06:41.697 --> 06:43.787
<b>-[ELYMAS] No, I won't.
-[bell jingles]</b>

06:47.327 --> 06:50.247
<b>I'd rather die
a slow death than tell anyone</b>

06:50.747 --> 06:52.757
<b>that I'm really the son
of a noble.</b>

06:53.797 --> 06:54.797
<b>[sighs]</b>

06:56.047 --> 06:57.387
<b>[birds chirping]</b>

06:58.757 --> 07:00.427
<b>♪</b>

07:02.887 --> 07:04.177
<b>Yeah!</b>

07:05.267 --> 07:07.267
<b>-Nice!
-That was fun, huh?</b>

07:07.397 --> 07:08.517
<b>[laughing]</b>

07:08.607 --> 07:11.437
<b>Come on! You're not gonna
catch me this time!</b>

07:28.827 --> 07:30.377
<b>[birds chirping]</b>

07:33.127 --> 07:34.167
<b>[sighs]</b>

07:35.707 --> 07:36.757
<b>Hmm.</b>

07:41.217 --> 07:43.257
<b>[door creaks]</b>

07:44.927 --> 07:49.017
<b>[coughing]</b>

07:49.137 --> 07:50.897
<b>[♪ ominous music playing]</b>

08:01.487 --> 08:03.157
<b>[ELYMAS] Will I really find
skill books</b>

08:03.277 --> 08:04.447
<b>in a place like this?</b>

08:09.827 --> 08:12.417
<b>Right there. I see five of them.</b>

08:12.917 --> 08:14.837
<b>That's some dinky armor.</b>

08:14.957 --> 08:16.167
<b>[gasps]</b>

08:17.507 --> 08:19.047
<b>The Hall of Broken Grimoires</b>

08:19.177 --> 08:21.337
<b>is a shop for those
who are more experienced,</b>

08:21.467 --> 08:23.307
<b>not for newbies like you.</b>

08:24.927 --> 08:27.017
<b>I, uh, I have some gold.</b>

08:27.137 --> 08:29.017
<b>Mind if I look
at those skill books?</b>

08:29.387 --> 08:31.187
<b>You're more than welcome
to look.</b>

08:31.307 --> 08:33.687
<b>Those filthy fingerprints
of yours aren't going</b>

08:33.807 --> 08:35.817
<b>to make them less valuable.</b>

08:37.187 --> 08:38.607
<b>Thank you.</b>

08:43.157 --> 08:45.197
<b>[AUTOMATED VOICE]
Beginner Archery Skill book.</b>

08:45.327 --> 08:48.037
<b>Market price, two million gold.</b>

08:48.157 --> 08:50.287
<b>[Elymas gasps] Unbelievable!</b>

08:50.407 --> 08:53.417
<b>That's 500,000 gold
more than it is in the game!</b>

08:54.247 --> 08:55.537
<b>In Magic World,</b>

08:55.667 --> 08:57.377
<b>the market price
was based on trades</b>

08:57.507 --> 08:59.127
<b>made between all the players.</b>

09:00.467 --> 09:02.677
<b>Then again,
the price for this item</b>

09:02.797 --> 09:05.927
<b>is probably based
on actual trade prices too.</b>

09:06.887 --> 09:09.307
<b>I'll bet the cost of every
skill book here is inflated</b>

09:09.427 --> 09:11.017
<b>due to nobles hoarding them.</b>

09:11.937 --> 09:13.977
<b>Just know if you plan
on buying that,</b>

09:14.107 --> 09:16.107
<b>I'll be charging
three million gold.</b>

09:16.227 --> 09:18.397
<b>What?! Three million?!</b>

09:18.527 --> 09:20.147
<b>Well, naturally.</b>

09:20.277 --> 09:22.697
<b>This is a risky business
I'm running here.</b>

09:22.817 --> 09:25.947
<b>And so far, the officials
have been looking the other way.</b>

09:26.617 --> 09:30.157
<b>But if their superiors learned
of this, I could lose my head.</b>

09:36.087 --> 09:38.047
<b>[Elymas groans] Even these basic</b>

09:38.167 --> 09:40.297
<b>beginner skill books
are expensive.</b>

09:42.167 --> 09:45.177
<b>If I ever decided
to sell the Daemonsrage Shield,</b>

09:45.297 --> 09:47.007
<b>I would only have
three million gold.</b>

09:48.757 --> 09:51.017
<b>Something tells me
I'd need more than that</b>

09:51.137 --> 09:53.517
<b>if I want to buy
a rare skill book.</b>

09:53.637 --> 09:54.807
<b>[inhales]</b>

09:56.977 --> 09:58.017
<b>Hmm.</b>

10:00.437 --> 10:03.527
<b>[ELYMAS] Beginner Archery,
Magic Booster,</b>

10:03.647 --> 10:06.907
<b>Jack-in-the-Box,
and Elemental Guard.</b>

10:07.027 --> 10:09.827
<b>Actually, all four of these
are pretty rare.</b>

10:09.947 --> 10:12.037
<b>But they're still not
what I'm looking for.</b>

10:12.747 --> 10:14.247
<b>What's this last one?</b>

10:18.457 --> 10:19.747
<b>[gasps]</b>

10:19.877 --> 10:22.627
<b>[spluttering]</b>

10:24.167 --> 10:25.837
<b>This is it! [gasps]</b>

10:25.967 --> 10:28.507
<b>The skill tree essential
to Heavy Knights.</b>

10:28.967 --> 10:31.217
<b>Fang of Smoldering Insanity!</b>

10:31.847 --> 10:34.517
<b>Once I have it, I'm golden!</b>

10:34.637 --> 10:35.807
<b>-[SHOPKEEP] What's this?
-[gasps]</b>

10:35.937 --> 10:37.647
<b>You seem happy.</b>

10:38.267 --> 10:41.857
<b>But if that's what you want,
then you must be a weirdo.</b>

10:41.977 --> 10:43.937
<b>Ma'am, how much
would this one be?</b>

10:44.067 --> 10:45.357
<b>Uh-huh!</b>

10:47.117 --> 10:49.237
<b>I'd charge 50 million.</b>

10:49.367 --> 10:50.577
<b>[gasps sharply]</b>

10:59.087 --> 11:00.417
<b>[sighs]</b>

11:00.537 --> 11:01.837
<b>I'm amazed you're displaying</b>

11:01.957 --> 11:04.257
<b>such an expensive item
with no guards here.</b>

11:04.377 --> 11:06.717
<b>[scoffs] If you think
I'm a weakling,</b>

11:06.837 --> 11:08.927
<b>play around and find out.</b>

11:09.047 --> 11:11.717
<b>I've thrown big guys
out on their asses.</b>

11:19.057 --> 11:20.147
<b>[sighs]</b>

11:20.267 --> 11:21.147
<b>Hmm?</b>

11:21.267 --> 11:23.067
<b>I have to have this.</b>

11:23.187 --> 11:25.487
<b>So do you think
you can hold it here for me?</b>

11:25.607 --> 11:29.157
<b>I promise, I'll come back
with 50 million gold.</b>

11:35.827 --> 11:37.077
<b>[Elymas groans]</b>

11:37.617 --> 11:39.167
<b>-[coughs]
-And what's in it for me</b>

11:39.287 --> 11:40.707
<b>if I say yes?</b>

11:41.247 --> 11:42.287
<b>[gasps]</b>

11:42.957 --> 11:44.507
<b>Well, I, uh...</b>

11:44.627 --> 11:47.757
<b>Kid, you do have spirit,
I'll give you that much.</b>

11:49.837 --> 11:52.927
<b>-[ELYMAS] Huh?
-All right. I can hold it.</b>

11:54.307 --> 11:56.767
<b>-You really will?
-Sure.</b>

11:59.137 --> 12:02.437
<b>For an extra
five million gold. Hmm?</b>

12:02.557 --> 12:05.437
<b>[Elymas gasps] This lady drives
a hard bargain.</b>

12:05.567 --> 12:07.317
<b>[laughs]</b>

12:11.027 --> 12:12.447
<b>[ELYMAS]
Guess I'd better find ways</b>

12:12.577 --> 12:14.367
<b>of making money for a while.</b>

12:15.497 --> 12:17.327
<b>[birds chirping]</b>

12:17.457 --> 12:19.417
<b>♪</b>

12:19.537 --> 12:21.127
<b>[indistinct chatter]</b>

12:21.247 --> 12:23.417
<b>[ADVENTURER] Tell me,
how'd it go with them?</b>

12:24.247 --> 12:25.627
<b>We made a perfect team.</b>

12:25.757 --> 12:27.467
<b>-And then, boom!
-No?</b>

12:27.587 --> 12:29.167
<b>[all laughing]</b>

12:30.047 --> 12:31.637
<b>[WOMAN 1] Do you like
how it turned out?</b>

12:32.007 --> 12:33.677
<b>[WOMAN 2] That's really cute!</b>

12:39.807 --> 12:40.887
<b>[sighs]</b>

12:42.187 --> 12:44.357
<b>Fifty-five million gold, huh?</b>

12:44.937 --> 12:46.277
<b>I'd have to earn 60 times</b>

12:46.397 --> 12:48.567
<b>what I made
on that last raid quest.</b>

12:49.607 --> 12:51.567
<b>High-level adventurers
and the shops</b>

12:51.697 --> 12:53.617
<b>they do business with,
really seem to have</b>

12:53.737 --> 12:55.577
<b>a busted perspective of wealth.</b>

12:57.287 --> 12:58.907
<b>Fang of Smoldering Insanity</b>

12:59.037 --> 13:00.657
<b>is one of the rarest
skill trees,</b>

13:00.787 --> 13:02.957
<b>but the only people
with a reason to build it</b>

13:03.077 --> 13:05.497
<b>are other Heavy Knights
and combat junkies</b>

13:05.627 --> 13:07.167
<b>with a major death wish.</b>

13:08.507 --> 13:10.717
<b>The skill books that are
more obviously powerful</b>

13:10.837 --> 13:12.967
<b>must be ridiculously expensive.</b>

13:13.087 --> 13:14.797
<b>[sighs] I have to come up</b>

13:14.927 --> 13:17.057
<b>with a practical way
to earn gold.</b>

13:17.967 --> 13:19.927
<b>I could try getting rich quick</b>

13:20.057 --> 13:21.807
<b>farming rare drops in dungeons.</b>

13:22.437 --> 13:24.687
<b>No. Heavy Knights
don't have the skills</b>

13:24.807 --> 13:26.767
<b>to deal consistent damage.</b>

13:28.397 --> 13:30.937
<b>I could start farming
weak monsters.</b>

13:31.067 --> 13:32.567
<b>[grunting]</b>

13:32.697 --> 13:34.987
<b>No, that would take
way too much time.</b>

13:36.527 --> 13:38.787
<b>I could try to look
for some other skill books</b>

13:38.907 --> 13:41.457
<b>and build up
those skill trees instead.</b>

13:42.327 --> 13:44.207
<b>No. I'd stop using them all</b>

13:44.327 --> 13:46.667
<b>once I acquired
Fang of Smoldering Insanity.</b>

13:47.997 --> 13:49.007
<b>Hmm.</b>

13:49.337 --> 13:51.257
<b>And I'd like to avoid
wasting my skill points.</b>

13:52.917 --> 13:54.137
<b>[sighs]</b>

13:54.757 --> 13:56.887
<b>Can't believe
I was so rude to that guy.</b>

13:57.007 --> 13:58.717
<b>[indistinct chatter, laughter]</b>

14:00.767 --> 14:03.727
<b>[ELYMAS] While I know
Heavy Knights aren't popular,</b>

14:03.847 --> 14:04.937
<b>that raid quest
still should have</b>

14:05.057 --> 14:06.357
<b>gotten my name out there.</b>

14:07.017 --> 14:08.107
<b>I'd have a lot more options</b>

14:08.227 --> 14:09.857
<b>if I teamed up
with other adventurers.</b>

14:10.987 --> 14:12.777
<b>Ah. Allies.</b>

14:14.897 --> 14:15.907
<b>[gasps]</b>

14:15.987 --> 14:18.487
<b>I'll keep it busy
so you can escape.</b>

14:18.617 --> 14:20.447
<b>So don't you worry
about a thing.</b>

14:20.577 --> 14:22.077
<b>-[grunts]
-[Wight snarls]</b>

14:22.197 --> 14:24.077
<b>[both panting]</b>

14:24.207 --> 14:26.127
<b>[both panting]</b>

14:26.247 --> 14:27.537
<b>[Gowtan grunts]</b>

14:29.837 --> 14:32.757
<b>How dare you doubt
Elymas's abilities?!</b>

14:32.877 --> 14:35.387
<b>I am the one
who approved his promotion,</b>

14:35.507 --> 14:37.967
<b>so you're all insulting me
as well!</b>

14:38.927 --> 14:40.757
<b>I guess I'll find allies.</b>

14:41.927 --> 14:44.847
<b>[MAN] Oh, man. I had no idea</b>

14:44.977 --> 14:47.267
<b>Blood-Soaked Sword
was going to drop.</b>

14:47.937 --> 14:49.267
<b>Hmm.</b>

14:49.767 --> 14:52.397
<b>[MAN] The market price for it
is two million gold.</b>

14:52.527 --> 14:54.647
<b>We can have a little fun
with that for a while.</b>

14:55.317 --> 14:58.737
<b>[giggling]</b>

15:01.277 --> 15:02.407
<b>Seems like my skills</b>

15:02.537 --> 15:03.867
<b>really helped us out
quite a bit,</b>

15:03.997 --> 15:05.207
<b>don't ya think?</b>

15:06.707 --> 15:08.747
<b>-[WOMAN] Silence.
-[girl groans]</b>

15:12.957 --> 15:14.967
<b>[GIRL] Aw. Come on, you guys.</b>

15:15.087 --> 15:17.217
<b>I thought they worked
pretty well, didn't they?</b>

15:18.297 --> 15:20.677
<b>[ELYMAS] Pretty sure
that's a swordsman, a bandit,</b>

15:20.797 --> 15:21.887
<b>and a pierrot.</b>

15:23.387 --> 15:25.267
<b>You think you helped?</b>

15:26.807 --> 15:29.557
<b>After visiting the dungeon
a bunch of times,</b>

15:29.687 --> 15:31.607
<b>we finally got this rare drop.</b>

15:31.727 --> 15:34.817
<b>So it was only a matter
of persistence and luck,</b>

15:34.937 --> 15:36.567
<b>not your skills.</b>

15:36.697 --> 15:38.487
<b>Uh... [chuckles awkwardly]</b>

15:38.607 --> 15:39.947
<b>-Yeah, you're right.
-[sighs]</b>

15:40.447 --> 15:43.537
<b>That said, when we visit
some more dungeons together,</b>

15:43.657 --> 15:46.077
<b>I think you'll start seeing
a big difference!</b>

15:46.207 --> 15:48.577
<b>After all,
we're just getting started.</b>

15:48.707 --> 15:51.247
<b>-Don't give me that, Ruche.
-[RUCHE] Huh?</b>

15:51.747 --> 15:53.207
<b>[gasps]</b>

15:53.667 --> 15:56.217
<b>After such a weak performance
like that,</b>

15:56.337 --> 15:58.337
<b>you think you're getting a cut
of the sale?</b>

15:59.547 --> 16:00.717
<b>What?</b>

16:01.177 --> 16:02.137
<b>[chuckles smugly]</b>

16:02.597 --> 16:03.677
<b>[♪ ominous music playing]</b>

16:06.887 --> 16:07.937
<b>But...</b>

16:08.387 --> 16:10.687
<b>Wait. I was risking my life
fighting on the front lines,</b>

16:10.807 --> 16:11.857
<b>just like the rest of you did.</b>

16:11.977 --> 16:14.437
<b>So couldn't I just
get an equal share?</b>

16:14.937 --> 16:16.437
<b>No, hold on.</b>

16:16.567 --> 16:19.607
<b>If I could have 200,000
or even 100,000 gold,</b>

16:19.737 --> 16:21.197
<b>-that would be plenty.
-[MAN] What?</b>

16:21.317 --> 16:22.487
<b>Only kidding.</b>

16:23.077 --> 16:24.277
<b>[sighs]</b>

16:24.827 --> 16:25.907
<b>Listen.</b>

16:26.037 --> 16:27.827
<b>You may be risking
your life out there,</b>

16:27.957 --> 16:29.787
<b>but you don't have
any decent attack skills.</b>

16:30.287 --> 16:31.917
<b>All you do is stand around</b>

16:32.037 --> 16:33.247
<b>-and soak up some hits.
-[gasps]</b>

16:33.377 --> 16:35.207
<b>That's the problem.
Are we clear?</b>

16:35.337 --> 16:38.087
<b>The truth is,
you're not actually useful.</b>

16:38.587 --> 16:39.627
<b>[gasps]</b>

16:45.097 --> 16:46.847
<b>[whimpering]</b>

16:49.477 --> 16:50.517
<b>I...</b>

16:51.187 --> 16:53.517
<b>I don't have any attack skills.</b>

16:54.147 --> 16:55.187
<b>Huh?</b>

16:55.437 --> 16:57.397
<b>[RUCHE] Because after gaining
my skill points,</b>

16:57.527 --> 16:59.527
<b>I spent them
the way you told me to.</b>

16:59.647 --> 17:01.317
<b>-What's that?
-[Ruche gasps]</b>

17:01.907 --> 17:04.027
<b>After we earned something
as a team,</b>

17:04.157 --> 17:07.737
<b>don't you think that it's mean
to say those things to me?</b>

17:08.697 --> 17:10.157
<b>[MAN] Excuse me?</b>

17:10.287 --> 17:11.457
<b>[Ruche whimpering]</b>

17:11.577 --> 17:15.287
<b>[MAN] So, I'm being "mean,"
is that it?</b>

17:17.167 --> 17:19.967
<b>Sounds to me like
you're a little confused.</b>

17:20.087 --> 17:21.297
<b>[gasps]</b>

17:21.417 --> 17:24.467
<b>You see, I just have a problem
giving up a portion</b>

17:24.597 --> 17:27.307
<b>of our take
to somebody who did nothing.</b>

17:27.427 --> 17:29.807
<b>Besides,
I only made a suggestion.</b>

17:30.477 --> 17:33.397
<b>You're the one who assigned
your skill points, remember?</b>

17:33.807 --> 17:36.147
<b>I can't believe you're actually
blaming me</b>

17:36.267 --> 17:38.477
<b>and demanding a share
after showing both of us</b>

17:38.607 --> 17:39.817
<b>how incompetent you are.</b>

17:39.937 --> 17:42.027
<b>[whimpering] Mr. Cline?</b>

17:42.777 --> 17:44.697
<b>[ELYMAS]
She got her build wrong,</b>

17:44.817 --> 17:47.367
<b>and now they're fighting over
how to split the treasure.</b>

17:47.987 --> 17:49.487
<b>Seems like this happened
all the time</b>

17:49.617 --> 17:51.077
<b>in Magic World too.</b>

17:51.537 --> 17:53.787
<b>You assign your skill points
to fit your party,</b>

17:53.917 --> 17:55.587
<b>but the situation changes.</b>

17:55.707 --> 17:57.707
<b>And then your choices
become meaningless.</b>

17:57.837 --> 17:59.337
<b>-Fine, fine.
-[Ruche whimpering]</b>

17:59.457 --> 18:00.877
<b>-[coins jingling]
-[CLINE] Here you go.</b>

18:01.167 --> 18:02.377
<b>[whimpers]</b>

18:03.087 --> 18:04.637
<b>One hundred thousand.</b>

18:05.257 --> 18:06.217
<b>[gasps]</b>

18:06.637 --> 18:08.767
<b>[CLINE] This is what
you wanted, right?</b>

18:08.887 --> 18:11.177
<b>So pick it up
and get out of here.</b>

18:11.887 --> 18:14.017
<b>Even though
your attack skills are weak,</b>

18:14.137 --> 18:17.107
<b>we took pity on you
and still kept you around.</b>

18:17.687 --> 18:19.777
<b>But now you're blinded
by chump change</b>

18:19.897 --> 18:21.817
<b>and showing us your true colors.</b>

18:21.937 --> 18:23.317
<b>-Isn't she?
-Hmm?</b>

18:24.027 --> 18:26.067
<b>[CLINE] Don't you agree, Reiss?</b>

18:26.407 --> 18:27.617
<b>[Reiss sighs]</b>

18:29.117 --> 18:31.447
<b>Yeah. I guess so.</b>

18:34.247 --> 18:36.417
<b>Just 'cause we got
some decent loot,</b>

18:36.537 --> 18:39.377
<b>it's not as if we can afford
to share it with anyone.</b>

18:39.497 --> 18:41.207
<b>Oh, no, you don't understand!</b>

18:41.337 --> 18:42.417
<b>That isn't what I meant!</b>

18:42.547 --> 18:43.967
<b>Uh, please forgive me!</b>

18:44.417 --> 18:45.837
<b>Both of you!</b>

18:45.967 --> 18:48.637
<b>I don't really need any gold
for the sword!</b>

18:48.757 --> 18:51.267
<b>-You can keep it.
-Your apologies won't cut it!</b>

18:51.387 --> 18:53.097
<b>-[whimpering]
-[CLINE] We've had enough.</b>

18:53.217 --> 18:54.347
<b>[gasps]</b>

18:55.307 --> 18:57.397
<b>[♪ somber music playing]</b>

18:57.937 --> 19:00.687
<b>Well, good luck
with your next party, at least.</b>

19:00.817 --> 19:02.317
<b>Then again, if I'm being honest,</b>

19:02.437 --> 19:04.647
<b>I can't imagine
who'd wanna recruit a loser</b>

19:04.777 --> 19:07.987
<b>who can't level up anymore
because of their awful build.</b>

19:08.117 --> 19:09.487
<b>But who knows!</b>

19:09.827 --> 19:10.947
<b>[Ruche sobbing]</b>

19:11.077 --> 19:13.447
<b>[ELYMAS] They say
relationships only last</b>

19:13.577 --> 19:15.157
<b>as long as the money does.</b>

19:15.657 --> 19:18.287
<b>The skill point system
is particularly brutal.</b>

19:18.417 --> 19:19.747
<b>[Ruche sobbing]</b>

19:20.377 --> 19:21.747
<b>[ELYMAS] You have to
farm monsters</b>

19:21.997 --> 19:26.047
<b>that are at or above your level
to get any decent experience.</b>

19:26.167 --> 19:27.887
<b>It's the only way to advance.</b>

19:28.757 --> 19:31.557
<b>Listen,
you may be risking your life,</b>

19:31.677 --> 19:33.057
<b>but you have no attack skills.</b>

19:33.177 --> 19:35.927
<b>All you do is stand there
and soak up hits.</b>

19:36.557 --> 19:38.437
<b>You're not actually useful.</b>

19:38.647 --> 19:39.807
<b>[gasps]</b>

19:40.437 --> 19:42.397
<b>[ELYMAS] But if your build
isn't viable,</b>

19:42.517 --> 19:43.607
<b>and you're constantly struggling</b>

19:43.727 --> 19:45.857
<b>to beat enemies
at your own level...</b>

19:46.317 --> 19:47.357
<b>No!</b>

19:47.817 --> 19:50.277
<b>...raising your level
can become incredibly difficult.</b>

19:50.407 --> 19:53.537
<b>[sobbing]</b>

19:54.037 --> 19:56.447
<b>[ELYMAS] I wonder if she put
her points in Speed Booster</b>

19:56.577 --> 19:59.377
<b>or a weapon skill tree
that she doesn't even need.</b>

20:01.127 --> 20:03.337
<b>As a pierrot,
is it a support tree?</b>

20:05.167 --> 20:07.587
<b>Didn't think
a Blood-Soaked Sword would drop.</b>

20:08.677 --> 20:09.757
<b>Hmm?</b>

20:09.887 --> 20:13.427
<b>[giggling]</b>

20:15.637 --> 20:16.847
<b>Seems like my skills</b>

20:16.977 --> 20:18.347
<b>really helped us out
quite a bit,</b>

20:18.477 --> 20:19.847
<b>don't ya think?</b>

20:22.977 --> 20:25.567
<b>[RUCHE] Aw, come on, you guys!</b>

20:25.687 --> 20:27.857
<b>I thought they worked
pretty well, didn't they?</b>

20:30.067 --> 20:32.117
<b>You think you helped us?</b>

20:33.577 --> 20:36.077
<b>After visiting the dungeon
a bunch of times,</b>

20:36.197 --> 20:38.247
<b>we finally got this rare drop.</b>

20:38.787 --> 20:41.327
<b>So it was only a matter
of persistence and luck,</b>

20:41.457 --> 20:43.167
<b>not your skills.</b>

20:43.287 --> 20:45.667
<b>[Elymas gasps] Could it be?</b>

20:45.797 --> 20:48.127
<b>-[Ruche sobbing]
-Does she have that skill tree?</b>

20:48.257 --> 20:49.837
<b>If he realized it,</b>

20:49.967 --> 20:52.217
<b>then he never would've
kicked her out like that.</b>

20:53.097 --> 20:54.807
<b>But based on what they said,</b>

20:54.927 --> 20:56.847
<b>I'm almost positive</b>

20:56.967 --> 20:59.177
<b>she has a certain
rare skill tree</b>

20:59.307 --> 21:01.727
<b>that's utterly broken
if you know how it works.</b>

21:01.847 --> 21:04.437
<b>[RUCHE] I'm so sorry
for being selfish!</b>

21:04.567 --> 21:06.777
<b>You don't ever
have to pay me again, okay?</b>

21:06.897 --> 21:09.187
<b>I promise! Please say
you'll keep me in the party</b>

21:09.317 --> 21:11.277
<b>-and I'll-- [gasps]
-[Elymas grunts]</b>

21:11.397 --> 21:13.817
<b>-[panting heavily]
-[gasps]</b>

21:13.947 --> 21:15.407
<b>Uh, who are you, mister?</b>

21:15.527 --> 21:16.787
<b>[ELYMAS] Hear me out!</b>

21:16.907 --> 21:17.907
<b>[screams]</b>

21:18.617 --> 21:20.407
<b>-[BOTH] Huh?
-[Ruche screams]</b>

21:20.537 --> 21:22.207
<b>[Elymas panting]</b>

21:22.327 --> 21:24.627
<b>Please! There's nothing
to be scared of.</b>

21:24.747 --> 21:26.747
<b>I just want you
to form a party with me!</b>

21:27.207 --> 21:28.877
<b>A p-party?!</b>

21:29.707 --> 21:30.967
<b>[both gasp]</b>

21:31.417 --> 21:33.587
<b>[panting heavily]</b>

21:36.507 --> 21:38.017
<b>[Ruche whimpers]</b>

21:40.807 --> 21:42.977
<b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b>

23:11.277 --> 23:13.437
<b>[ELYMAS] After figuring out
I needed to join a team,</b>

23:13.897 --> 23:15.777
<b>I started looking
for party members.</b>

23:15.897 --> 23:17.987
<b>So I reached out
to a pierrot girl.</b>

23:18.697 --> 23:20.867
<b>Ugh, now that I think about it,</b>

23:20.987 --> 23:23.157
<b>maybe that was
a bit sketchy of me.</b>

23:23.617 --> 23:24.657
<b>That said,</b>

23:24.907 --> 23:25.997
<b>the ones who kicked her
out of their group</b>

23:26.117 --> 23:27.917
<b>didn't even realize
what they had.</b>

23:28.327 --> 23:30.127
<b>But I can see how truly valuable</b>

23:30.247 --> 23:31.547
<b>her skills will be.</b>

23:32.837 --> 23:35.257
<b>Next time, "Ruche the Pierrot."</b>

23:35.377 --> 23:38.007
<b>To succeed,
I have to recruit her.</b>
